warning[identical_case_bodies]: `case .JPEG` does the same as `case .PNG`
  --> tests/lint/identical_case_bodies/example.jai:13:9
   |
13 |         case .JPEG;
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: list the values together: `case .PNG, .JPEG;`
   |
11 -         case .PNG;
12 -             return "image";
13 -         case .JPEG;
14 -             return "image";
11 +         case .PNG, .JPEG;
12 +             return "image";
   |
